/**
 * Lightflow Terrain Render for Blockbench
 * =======================================
 *
 * A dependency-free Blockbench plugin plus a reusable little-endian NBT and
 * Minecraft Bedrock .mcstructure codec. The codec contains two layers:
 *
 * 1. LittleEndianNBTReader
 *    Parses the complete classic NBT tag set using Bedrock's little-endian encoding.
 *
 * 2. MinecraftBedrockStructure
 *    Validates and exposes the semantic contents of a Bedrock .mcstructure file:
 *    dimensions, block layers, palettes, block states, block entities, scheduled
 *    ticks, entities, coordinate conversion, iteration, statistics, and helpers
 *    suitable for importing blocks into Blockbench.
 *
 * No external libraries are required.
 *
 * Runtime requirements:
 * - Modern Chromium / Blockbench
 * - Node.js 12+ (BigInt and TextDecoder support are preferred)
 *
 * @license MIT-0
 */

